:: Carter Bedroom Collectables Photo [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
You are browsing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s collection of memorabilia when you stumble upon the shelf full of signed photos, all with <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> at different ages with a variety of actors. While you only recognize some of them, you are quickly able to piece together who they are based on the drawn logo on each one. Various actors for Ultraman, some for Owlman, Noah would be jealous, and even more for the large variety of other heroes in the same franchise as Ultraman. He sure has been to a lot of conventions. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },	
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“Oh, yeah. There’s a big convention every year in the city here for comic books and stuff. Dad’s been taking be every year since I was basically a toddler. I try to get pictures with everyone I can.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">laughs with a slight blush, though obviously cares deeply about his photos as he walks over and begins to point out some of the actors to you.</span> <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“He’s there every year, he’s pretty old, but he played Ultraman back when my dad was a kid! After the first few years, he started recognizing me by name. He even called me his… well, that’s a little embarrassing.”</span> <br>
<br>
Looking at the collection of photos with the man, it seems this is the longest running series of Photos <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> had, dating all the way back to when he was about three. He also has a signed poster from the movie this actor played him on his wall. <span style="color:Pink">It’s rather cute.</span> <br>
<br>

<div id="choice">
    <<link "That’s so cool<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">You smile, admitting that’s very cool!</span> You bet the man can tell how much <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> not only loves Ultraman, but loves helping people. He probably remembers him because he hears all the stories of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> helping out the town. Maybe he considers him his little sidekick. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> instantly starts to glow bright pink at your words but can’t hide his smile. <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“That- that is what he calls me.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="color:Pink">begins to turn back and forth shyly, staring down at his fingers, <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I was in the paper before the convention for something I did in first grade and he saw it. He called me his honorary sidekick.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> immediately buries his face in his hands and leaps onto his bed, making an embarrassed groan as you laugh. That’s pretty adorable. If anyone deserves to be an official hero sidekick, it’s <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>.</span> <br>
        <br>

        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 5>>
        <span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 5>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
    <<link "Point out his pull-ups are showing in the first photo<br>">>
    <<replace "#choice">>
        <span style="color:Pink">With a smirk, you point to a little splash of color in the first photo with the actor, asking <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> if those are his little toddler pull-ups showing.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> immediately blushes at this, knowing exactly what you’re talking about as he responds <span style="color:LightSteelBlue">“I was three! Plus, I was so nervous, we didn’t want to risk any… shut up!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> picks up a pillow and hits you with it. <br>
        <br>
        The two of you wrestle on the ground some more, you tease asking if he’s wearing any pull-ups right now and peeking under his shorts and tugging at his briefs as he tries to fight you off. <span style="color:Pink">It’s a wholesome wrestling match of teasing between friends and despite his red cheeks, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> seems to be enjoying himself.</span> <br>

        <span style="color:Green">+Carter Fun</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Fun += 5>>
        <span style="color:green">+Carter Comfort</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Comfort += 5>>
        <span style="color:red">-Carter Energy</span><br>
        <<set $HangOutNeed.Energy -= 5>>
        <<needChange "Fun" 5>>
        <<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Carter House Carter Bedroom]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>